docs {
  # GET /api/v1/article-detail

  Detail view for a single MBG article: AI summary, category, relative time,
  per-article forecast, and supporting signals.

  **Source:** `apps/web/app/api/v1/article-detail/route.ts`
  **Auth:** `requireRole("viewer")` (run *Auth Login* first). Needs Postgres.

  ## Query params
  `url`, `title`, `source`, `date`, `score` — describe the article to expand
  (the dashboard forwards the clicked article's fields).

  ## Response (200) — `ArticleDetail`
  ```json
  {
    "title": "...", "source": "detik.com", "url": "https://...",
    "score": 7, "category": "Keamanan Pangan", "relative_time": "3 jam lalu",
    "summary": "...",
    "forecast": { "question": "...", "trend": "up", "probability": 64, "timeframe": "7 hari", "reasoning": "...", "recommendation": "..." },
    "signals": [ { "source": "...", "type": "...", "quote": "..." } ]
  }
  ```
}
